Phonon 31M English (gradium/phonon-31m-en) weights, tokenizer and voices, and the voices from
gradium/phonon-voices, are released by Gradium under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE in
vendor/phonon-tts). Phonon builds on Pocket TTS and the Mimi codec by Kyutai.
The phonon-tts browser runtime is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.
Responsible use: do not use these voices to impersonate real people; tell listeners speech is synthetic where it matters.
